lear enemies and events your deck gains cards unique to the floor. Each floor has a unique pool of cards that work well together.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose a Path to Control your Deck's Evolution </h2>Each level you have a choice of 2 floors with a unique card pool. You always have the option to continue acquiring cards of the same type or to branch off into a different random card type. As you clear levels the random floors increase in difficulty.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock New Starting Decks</h2>Every floor you defeat you gain a new deck that you can start a run with. This new deck has cards specific to the floor's unique cards.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023500/extras/77c62abc2f8e33db9ef5ce84ed65f66c.poster.avif?t=1688488406\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023500/extras/77c62abc2f8e33db9ef5ce84ed65f66c.webm?t=1688488406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023500/extras/77c62abc2f8e33db9ef5ce84ed65f66c.mp4?t=1688488406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
